                      (    forth6809.asm):03534         
D3BF                  (    forth6809.asm):03535         TNDOUBLE:                           ; U currently holds [UDLO(bottom), UDHI(top)], matching
                      (    forth6809.asm):03536                                             ; ANS's (ud1) stack order directly.
