                      (    forth6809.asm):06161         ; Remainder of n1 divided by n2. Division truncates toward zero; the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06162         ; remainder has the sign of the dividend. THROW -10 if the divisor is
                      (    forth6809.asm):06163         ; zero.
