E80B A780             (    forth6809.asm):07543                     STA   ,X+
E80D 5A               (    forth6809.asm):07544                     DECB
E80E 26F9             (    forth6809.asm):07545                     BNE   SQICPY
E810 39               (    forth6809.asm):07546         SQIEND:     RTS
